GluFormer × OpenEvolve
======================

This repository builds on GluFormer, a foundation model for continuous glucose
monitoring data.

Original work — GluFormer
-------------------------
  Authors:  Guy Lutsker, Gal Sapir, Smadar Shilo, Hagai Rossman, Eran Segal, et al.
  Paper:    A foundation model for continuous glucose monitoring data,
            Nature (2026). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-025-09925-9
  Source:   https://github.com/Guylu/GluFormer
  License:  Apache License 2.0

